      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00017",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[17]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 951,
      "endIndex": 979,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. Non-Goals / Out of Scope",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00018",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[18]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 979,
      "endIndex": 1118,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.7da76e7nax2",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "No change to the Interaction Checker's medication search, selected medications, interaction results, clinical content, or classifications.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00019",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[19]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1118,
      "endIndex": 1191,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.7da76e7nax2",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "No change to the interaction details already displayed in the monograph.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00020",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[20]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1191,
      "endIndex": 1291,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.7da76e7nax2",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "No new or changed access point outside the Check interactions action in the Interactions accordion.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00021",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[21]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1291,
      "endIndex": 1357,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.7da76e7nax2",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "No redesign of the monograph or the existing Interaction Checker.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00022",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[22]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1357,
      "endIndex": 1358,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00023",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[23]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1358,
      "endIndex": 1374,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "4. User Stories",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00024",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[24]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1374,
      "endIndex": 1557,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.p8rdvoiuzhp6",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "As a clinician reviewing a drug monograph, I want to select Check interactions from the Interactions accordion, so I can check a medication combination without leaving the monograph.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00025",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[25]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1557,
      "endIndex": 1711,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.p8rdvoiuzhp6",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "As a clinician using the checker, I want the monograph to remain in place behind the sidebar, so I can return to the same review context when I close it.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00026",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[26]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1711,
      "endIndex": 1878,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.p8rdvoiuzhp6",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "As a keyboard or screen-reader user, I want the action and sidebar controls to be clearly labeled and operable, so I can access and dismiss the checker independently.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00027",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[27]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1878,
      "endIndex": 2030,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.p8rdvoiuzhp6",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "As a clinician when the checker is unavailable, I want to remain able to read the monograph, so an unavailable checker does not block my normal review.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00028",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[28]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2030,
      "endIndex": 2031,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00029",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[29]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2031,
      "endIndex": 2047,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "5. Requirements",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00030",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[30]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2047,
      "endIndex": 2062,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Must-Have (P0)",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00031",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[31]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2062,
      "endIndex": 2106,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "R1 — Access from the Interactions accordion",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00032",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[32]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2106,
      "endIndex": 2189,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "☐ The Interactions accordion displays a clearly labeled Check interactions action.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00033",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[33]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2189,
      "endIndex": 2311,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "☐ Selecting Check interactions opens the existing Medscape Interaction Checker in a sidebar beside the current monograph.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00034",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[34]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2311,
      "endIndex": 2427,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "☐ The action can be reached and activated with a keyboard and has an accessible name that communicates its purpose.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00035",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[35]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2427,
      "endIndex": 2428,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00036",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[36]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2428,
      "endIndex": 2463,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "R2 — In-context sidebar experience",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00037",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[37]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2463,
      "endIndex": 2653,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "☐ When the sidebar opens, the clinician can use the established V2 Interaction Checker experience, including entering medications and reviewing the checker's available results and messages.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00038",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[38]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2653,
      "endIndex": 2769,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "☐ The current monograph remains visible but inactive behind the open sidebar, and its scroll position is preserved.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00039",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[39]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2769,
      "endIndex": 2946,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "☐ The sidebar has a clearly labeled close control. Closing it returns the clinician to the same Interactions accordion context and returns keyboard focus to Check interactions.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00040",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[40]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2946,
      "endIndex": 3068,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "☐ On supported narrow viewports, the checker remains usable and can be closed without preventing access to the monograph.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00041",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[41]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3068,
      "endIndex": 3069,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00042",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[42]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3069,
      "endIndex": 3099,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "R3 — Safe availability states",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00043",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[43]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3099,
      "endIndex": 3277,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "☐ While the checker is opening or loading, the sidebar provides an understandable in-progress state. The clinician can dismiss the sidebar and return to the unchanged monograph.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00044",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[44]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3277,
      "endIndex": 3436,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "☐ If the checker cannot be loaded, the sidebar displays its standard unavailable state and can be dismissed so the clinician can continue using the monograph.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00045",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[45]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3436,
      "endIndex": 3576,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
