      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "8. Definition of Done",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00062",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[62]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4570,
      "endIndex": 4626,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Phase 1 is complete when all of the following are true:",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00063",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[63]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4626,
      "endIndex": 4747,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.4r1uax3m0web",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Check interactions is available from the Interactions accordion and opens the existing Interaction Checker in a sidebar.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00064",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[64]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4747,
      "endIndex": 4882,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.4r1uax3m0web",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The open and close path preserves the clinician's monograph context, including the Interactions accordion context and scroll position.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00065",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[65]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4882,
      "endIndex": 4980,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.4r1uax3m0web",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The action and sidebar are operable with a keyboard and understandable with assistive technology.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00066",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[66]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4980,
      "endIndex": 5087,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.4r1uax3m0web",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The established checker experience is available without changing its medication-entry or results behavior.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00067",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[67]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5087,
      "endIndex": 5203,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.4r1uax3m0web",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Loading and unavailable states allow the sidebar to be dismissed so the clinician can continue using the monograph.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00068",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[68]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5203,
      "endIndex": 5339,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.4r1uax3m0web",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The approved narrow-viewport presentation is validated, and the release-quality and user-outcome measurements are ready to be assessed.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
